{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/dd08oj","slideIndex":7,"text":"LoRP的实际式为(LN(X)A+a)B+b，768到4到768，默认无GELU。输入搜索组N=512，拆分后U为1024×384。Phi为384×8。Dispatch沿输入子token维softmax，每个槽位的输入权重和为1。温度TD为可学习参数，初值1，未约束为正。\n\n来源：\n/Users/lzy/Desktop/GitHub/seatrack/SEATrack-main/lib/models/layers/attn.py"}
