{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jdnqh5","slideIndex":10,"text":"CenterPredictor在本地项目中定义，内部卷积BN/ReLU来自PyTorch。最终只保留搜索，模板信息已融入搜索。每个分支四层3×3 Conv-BN-ReLU，通道768、256、128、64、32，最后1×1卷积。中心和尺寸sigmoid后clamp，偏移保持实数。\n\n来源：\n/Users/lzy/Desktop/GitHub/seatrack/SEATrack-main/lib/models/seatrack/vit_ci.py\n/Users/lzy/Desktop/GitHub/seatrack/SEATrack-main/lib/models/seatrack/seatrack.py\n/Users/lzy/Desktop/GitHub/seatrack/SEATrack-main/lib/models/layers/head.py"}
